<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results from the</p>
<p>European indoor championship on Thursday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>3-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat 7-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>6-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Karina Habsudova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 7-5 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>2-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Judith Wiesner (Austria) 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
